OL,3,AHome secretary setting out changes to
OL,4,Asettlement rules for legal migrants -
OL,5,Awatch live
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Conservatives have said that any
OL,8,Fwatering down of the proposal would be
OL,9,Fa "slap in the face to British
OL,10,Ftaxpayers"
OL,12,FIndefinite leave to remain (ILR), also
OL,13,Fknown as settlement, gives a person the
OL,14,Fright to live, work and study in the UK
OL,15,Ffor as long as they like and apply for
OL,16,Fbenefits if they are eligible
